+Technicians enter an equipment serial number and need its calibration date, due date, and equipment description. A signed snapshot delivered via USB contains newline-delimited JSON records, a schema version, a snapshot date, and a signature manifest. Registry data is read-only on the kiosk and serves approximately 90,000 serial numbers from snapshots up to 150 MB on 4 GB RAM hardware.
 
